PLACEHOLDER: the production release signing public key goes here.

This file must hold the RSA-3072 public key (SubjectPublicKeyInfo PEM, the
"-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----" block) whose private half is the RELEASE_SIGNING_KEY
secret of the release workflow. Until it does:
  - the server answers 500 for /kiosk/release-signing.pub.pem and .xml;
  - a Mac install stops before it downloads the helper, and installs nothing;
  - a Windows install installs the launcher but not the updater, and says so
    only in the installer's own output;
  - the release workflow stops before it tags;
  - release-signing-key.test.ts "is an RSA-3072 public key" fails.
See docs/ops/distribution.md, "The release signing key".
